 a Dangerous Game,\" adding to the pun-filled humor.\n\nThe overall color scheme of the poster is a mix of warm, bakery hues with the gritty, dark tones reminiscent of the original show, blending the intense drama of Breaking Bad with the lighthearted, culinary twist of \"Breaking Bread.\""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 10, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [9], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [1248, 192], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 24, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 12, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [985.3012084960938, 1060.3828125], "pos": [1511, 198], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 9, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [12], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [315, 58], "pos": [854, 756], "widgets_values": ["ae.sft"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "locali